  "releaseNotes": "0.6.7 adds SIMD (NEON on ARM64, SSE and AVX2 on x64) to HDR reconstruction and tone mapping and to DrawImage blend modes, ApplyMask and AutoCrop: up to 5x faster on x64. HDR results are now bit-identical on x64 and ARM64 (own deterministic float math; floats differ from 0.6.5 by a few ulp); graphics results are unchanged. No API changes. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp/blob/v0.6.7/docs/releases/release-0.6.7.md",
